# [DD-13b.W1.1 r46sem finding 4, RULED] `engine dfa` — only `vm` is
# defined for W1.1. All three parsers must refuse this identically: leg A
# and leg C used to accept it; leg B already refused it (the parser that
# actually runs the corpus). `docs/spec/rxt_format.md`'s own paragraph and
# its --list-source column table now agree with all three.
pattern a+
engine dfa
m "aaa" 0 3
